+## Exact organization sink read exception — 3 October 2026
+
+User-approved task-local correction: only this literal command is permitted:
+
+```sh
+/workspace/.setup/cloud-gcloud gcloud -- logging sinks list --organization=594773370606 --format='json(name,destination,filter,disabled,includeChildren,interceptChildren,exclusions)'
+```
+
+For that exact argv, the SDK command omits the forced CLI `--project` to avoid
+gcloud's mutually exclusive parent flags. It retains the existing fixed account,
+project environment, credential activation, protected flags, TLS, output redaction
+and private invocation cleanup. Direct and guarded Python-shim routes share the
+same command builder. Every other command retains its forced project selector.
+Other organization IDs, selectors/abbreviations, organization writes, added flags,
+changed formats and release-track variants are rejected before authentication.
+No new IAM role, credential, endpoint or network host is introduced.
+
+All 30 offline adapter tests passed, including exact-command and rejection cases.
